# Our Little Story and Cake Stickers

Status: DONE
Milestone: M3 Requested local implementation and review complete; user/native acceptance and launch separate
Dependencies: 01_PRODUCT_DECISIONS.todo, 02_REFERENCES_AND_PHOTOGRAPHY.todo, 04_VISUAL_DESIGN.todo, 05_WEBSITE_AND_ORDERING.todo, 06_TESTING_AND_LAUNCH.todo, 08_READABILITY_AND_SIMPLE_ORDERING.todo

## Purpose

Implement the user's explicit request to bring back the original Our little story
immediately below the first section and the chosen background-removed white cake
stickers. This supersedes the earlier three-section-only policy without reviving
FAQs, forms, new biography or a separate custom-cake section. Keep source
preservation, local verification, visual judgement and user approval distinct.

