## Acceptance criteria

- [x] The original story/note is immediately between home and cakes, with no new biography.
- [x] Five real cakes remain directly enquireable; Instagram handoff/no-prefill is unchanged.
- [x] Mask recipes and provenance are separate from original RGB/source photographs.
- [x] No clipped cherries, dress base or upper feather are reconstructed or called perfect.
- [x] Final derivatives decode with transparency, expected dimensions and matching hashes.
- [x] Parent visually reviewed source/mask comparisons; opaque-pixel/feather-eye
  checks pass and source-clipping limitations remain disclosed.
- [x] Readability styles retain 18px reading copy/reduced motion; actual browser checks
  pass 16px+ key labels, 48px controls, focus/navigation and usable 200% text without overflow.
- [x] View larger photo loads the full prepared JPG; direct links work without JavaScript.
- [x] The actual public output is 53 files, with 20 sticker variants
  under site\assets\stickers; masks/manifests/recipes/private artifacts are excluded.
- [x] User visual acceptance is explicitly unrecorded, separate from successful local checks.
- [x] Publication remains blocked until explicitly approved.

## Separate acceptance and release gates

These do not reopen the completed requested local implementation:

- [ ] Actual user visual/representative-customer acceptance — workstreams 01, 04 and 08.
- [ ] Native Instagram/WhatsApp, real-device and assistive-technology acceptance — 06 and 08.
- [ ] Approved business facts, suitable hosting and explicit public launch — 01 and 06.

